[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9540.15, "timestamp": "02:39:00", "text": "我只是……我不知道如果有的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9543.349, "timestamp": "02:39:03", "text": "还有其他人来吗？呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9546.95, "timestamp": "02:39:06", "text": "会让它更合身。我这样说是："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9549.67, "timestamp": "02:39:09", "text": "根据星星的数量来算，对吧？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9552.389, "timestamp": "02:39:12", "text": "是的，我觉得现在大部分都是这样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9554.71, "timestamp": "02:39:14", "text": "美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9563.67, "timestamp": "02:39:23", "text": "我猜也是。但再次强调，这个网站的想法是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9565.75, "timestamp": "02:39:25", "text": "好多了。我们不需要一个男人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9568.79, "timestamp": "02:39:28", "text": "OBS 和其他所有东西。我们只能看着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9572.469, "timestamp": "02:39:32", "text": "其他人也加入进来，令人愉悦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9577.349, "timestamp": "02:39:37", "text": "他们自己以及网站本身"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9579.75, "timestamp": "02:39:39", "text": "而且这不仅限于人类。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9581.59, "timestamp": "02:39:41", "text": "来到溪边的人。不，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9585.19, "timestamp": "02:39:45", "text": "将仅限于此，并且仅限于此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9586.79, "timestamp": "02:39:46", "text": "每个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9589.83, "timestamp": "02:39:49", "text": "即使错过了，你也可以添加。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9592.469, "timestamp": "02:39:52", "text": "把自己当作装饰品，当作一场音乐会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9594.23, "timestamp": "02:39:54", "text": "盘子之类的东西。我的天哪，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9597.59, "timestamp": "02:39:57", "text": "就像我之前提到的那样。所以，我们"}]